  <h2>Why Cheap Wireless Mics Sound "Robotic"?</h2>
  <p>Agar aap Amazon par ₹2,000 ke paas wale wireless mic buy karte hain, toh sabse zyaada log ek hi cheez complain karte hain: <i>"Jaise hi noise cancellation button dabate hain, aawaz paani ke andar se ya robot jaisi aane lagti hai."</i></p>
  <p>Noise cancellation ke chakkar me cheap DSP chips background fan noise ke saath aapki vocal warmth bhi kaat dete hain. Studio ya indoor room me hamesha Noise Cancellation <b>OFF</b> rakhein aur room ka fan slow kar dein. ANC ko tabhi ON karein jab outdoor heavy road noise ho.</p>

